liblqr

# --- FaceTime HD webcam (MacBook) --------------------------------------------
# Runtime deps for the facetimehd-tools package (cam-control GUI + cam-* helpers,
# built from local:pkgbuilds/facetimehd-tools). Driver/firmware come from the AUR
# build list; these are the repo-side apps the helpers shell out to:
#   guvcview            - V4L2 camera app that works on the Haswell GPU (no GL sink)
#   gst-plugin-pipewire - GStreamer<->PipeWire bridge (webcam view/photo helper)
#   gst-plugins-good    - xvimagesink / jpegenc / videoconvert for the helper
#   v4l-utils           - v4l2-ctl (control enumeration + the cam-tune enforcer)
#   polkit-gnome        - graphical polkit agent for the pkexec camera toggle
# NOTE: NO inline `# comments` on package lines — mkarchiso's `sed 's/#.*//'`
# leaves the trailing whitespace, producing "guvcview   " which pacman can't
# resolve ("target not found"). Keep one bare package per line.
guvcview
gst-plugin-pipewire
gst-plugins-good
v4l-utils
polkit-gnome

